     1|/**
     2| * IVX Senior Developer Narrative Engine (RESPONSE ENGINE)
     3| *
     4| * Owner mandate 2026-07-20 Phases 7 + 10: a SEPARATE response engine that reads
     5| * the structured execution record and produces an owner-readable response.
     6| *
     7| * The response engine MUST NOT invent actions that are absent from the
     8| * execution record. It reads the record and explains the result clearly,
     9| * separating facts from assumptions and reporting failures honestly.
    10| *
    11| * The 7-section format (owner-mandated):
    12| *   1. DIRECT ANSWER
    13| *   2. WHAT WAS WRONG
    14| *   3. WHAT I CHANGED
    15| *   4. WHY THIS FIX WORKS
    16| *   5. TESTS PERFORMED
    17| *   6. PRODUCTION PROOF
    18| *   7. WHAT IS STILL NOT VERIFIED
    19| *
    20| * Forbidden vague language (unless every required acceptance test has
    21| * supporting evidence): "Everything is working", "Fully complete",
    22| * "Enterprise-ready", "Verified end to end".
    23| */
    24|
    25|import type { IVXExecutionRecord } from './ivx-execution-record';
